{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788112462700642519,"compiled_state":{"alias":"uncheering-uncivil-pig","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"b761c4e4343353a96b45033d38c4291a0e34881289793e2d1f0220ccb1be3567","event_uuid":"cd6f6fce-19f8-4efd-b423-b5001b9ece32","position":{"commit_sha":"8fd5f8ee255d83d4b9f9c312ace3bc68375e74f4","position":"1788112361078681264-cd6f6fce-19f8-4efd-b423-b5001b9ece32"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"856d67b76e2f9f33317c2e2311f9a4a0589c2748ece1b6eee0bdb9981eb24111","event_uuid":"a9145fbe-0e93-4eb4-84fc-59d6e440481b","position":{"commit_sha":"ddf2f92febc3d8b484762c413361e048b8c3bb58","position":"1788112462700642518-a9145fbe-0e93-4eb4-84fc-59d6e440481b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788112361078681264,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"a9145fbe-0e93-4eb4-84fc-59d6e440481b","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"dc2c-0bb5-4272-46f3"}],"description":"## Problem\n`src/rebar/llm/code_review/detectors.py:196` and\n`src/rebar/llm/code_review/bugfix_size_gate.py:413` hardcode a `severity` string\n(`\"critical\"`, `\"high\"`) directly into a kernel-shaped finding without ever running through\n`pass3_decide` (`review_kernel/decide.py`), so these DET-tier findings carry no computed\n`validity`/`impact`/`priority`. The epic is migrating every consumer of `severity`\n(aggregation ranking, the review-bot comment, the `fail_on_severity` workflow gate) onto\n`priority` instead; DET-tier findings need a `priority` value before those consumers can\ntreat all findings uniformly.\n\n## Approach\nAt each hardcode site, replace the `severity` key with a fixed `priority` float (keeping the\nexisting always-block semantics): the secrets detector's finding always blocks, so its\npriority is pinned above every configured `block_threshold` (`priority: 1.0`); the\nbugfix-size-gate's finding is a strong-but-not-maximal signal (`priority: 0.9`). Add a\n`decision: \"block\"` key alongside at both sites so downstream consumers can rely on\n`decision`/`priority` uniformly regardless of whether a finding came from the LLM kernel or a\nDET-tier check.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `detectors.py`'s secrets-detector finding carries `priority: 1.0` and `decision: \"block\"`\n  instead of `severity: \"critical\"`.\n- [ ] `bugfix_size_gate.py`'s size-gate finding carries `priority: 0.9` and `decision: \"block\"`\n  instead of `severity: \"high\"`.\n- [ ] `pytest tests/unit/test_code_review_detectors.py` and the bugfix-size-gate test module\n  (locate via `pytest --collect-only -q -k bugfix_size_gate`) pass, with assertions on the new\n  `priority`/`decision` keys.\n- [ ] `grep -rn '\"severity\"' src/rebar/llm/code_review/detectors.py src/rebar/llm/code_review/bugfix_size_gate.py`\n  returns no matches.\n\n## Testing\nTier: in-process unit test against the real detector/gate functions (pure calculation, no\nI/O). Oracle: the returned finding dict's `priority` and `decision` keys, asserted by value.\nExisting tests in `tests/unit/test_code_review_detectors.py` (and the size-gate's sibling\ntest file) are the RED oracle to strengthen.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","dc2c-0bb5-4272-46f3"],["parent","c4c8-317a-85ca-4b08"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"c4c8-317a-85ca-4b08","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"e0d5-2b29-2814-4421","ticket_type":"task","title":"Assign fixed priority to DET-tier findings (secrets detector, bugfix-size gate)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["cd6f6fce-19f8-4efd-b423-b5001b9ece32","a9145fbe-0e93-4eb4-84fc-59d6e440481b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788112462700642519,"uuid":"248c5402-0c68-4f2b-beef-8055de70e4ea"}